caption: Embodied Gift Scope
tradition-component: embodied-gift-scope

Spawn may use only Eldritch Core Gifts that are effectively body parts or bodily structures. A legal Gift must describe supernatural anatomy: limbs, organs, tissues, glands, armor, sensory structures, mouths, internal spaces, additional brains, or similar physical modifications. The effect may be impossible, but it must genuinely be produced by the character's body. Latent Gifts may be used for Spawn discovery and Realization normally; a Realized Gift can support Spawn only through an existing stable bodily realization that qualifies as a Gift Trait below.

Generic telekinesis, luck, free-floating force fields, disembodied attacks, or other effects with no anatomical source are not legal Spawn Gifts merely because the player can describe them with biological imagery.
